# Record

`example.dev/v1` · Namespaced · [all resources](../README.md)

| Operation | Request |
|---|---|
| observe | `GET /zones/{zone_id}/records/{record_id}` |
| create | `POST /zones/{zone_id}/records` |
| update | `PATCH /zones/{zone_id}/records/{record_id}` |
| delete | `DELETE /zones/{zone_id}/records/{record_id}` |

References: `zoneRef` → Zone.

Credentials: via zone → account.

## Example

```yaml
apiVersion: example.dev/v1
kind: Record
metadata:
  name: example
spec:
  forProvider:
    zoneRef:
      name: <name>
```

## Spec

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `deletionPolicy` | string |  | `Orphan` keeps the external resource when the managed resource is deleted. Without `Delete` in `managementPolicies` the resource is always orphaned. One of `Delete`, `Orphan`. Default `Delete`. |
| `forProvider` | object | yes |  |
| `forProvider.name` | string |  | Fully qualified record name. |
| `forProvider.proxied` | boolean |  |  |
| `forProvider.settings` | object |  |  |
| `forProvider.settings.flatten_cname` | boolean |  |  |
| `forProvider.settings.ipv4_only` | boolean |  |  |
| `forProvider.tags` | []string |  |  |
| `forProvider.ttl` | integer (uint32) |  | Time to live in seconds. Minimum 0. |
| `forProvider.zoneRef` | object |  |  |
| `forProvider.zoneRef.name` | string | yes |  |
| `managementPolicies` | []string |  | Actions the controller may take. `["*"]` (default) allows all; `["Observe"]` only reads (import without management). `Observe` is always required. Default `["*"]`. |

Validation:

- `forProvider`: ttl must be 1 (automatic) or at least 30 seconds

## Status

`conditions` holds `Ready` and `Synced`; `atProvider` is the resource as the API returns it.

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `atProvider.created_on` | string |  | When the record was created. |
| `atProvider.id` | string | yes |  |
| `atProvider.name` | string | yes |  |
| `atProvider.ttl` | integer (uint32) | yes | Minimum 0. |
